Merging Feature Branches

> At some point new the work on the feature branches will need to be merged in to
  the master branch!
  There are a couple of options for how to do this...

  1. Merge at will, without any sort of discussion with teammates.
     JUST DO IT WHENEVER YOU WANT

  2. Send an email or chat message or something to your team to discuss if the
     changes should be merged in.

  3. Pull Request!